The recorded host is Ubuntu 22.04 with ROS 2 Humble, compiler/CMake, Boost, Eigen, PCL and TBB already available. See [build log](logs/task01_build.md) for dependency checks, upstream revisions and compatibility changes. ROS and native build dependencies are prerequisites; these commands do not install system packages. Do not modify unrelated ROS workspaces.

